#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:2
msgid "AI Social Scientist 使用指南"
msgstr "AI Social Scientist User Guide"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:4
msgid ""
"**AI Social Scientist** 是 AgentSociety 2 的交互式研究助手，以 VSCode "
"扩展的形式提供可视化配置、后端管理和研究编排能力。它支持两种使用方式："
msgstr ""
"**AI Social Scientist** is the interactive research assistant for "
"AgentSociety 2, provided as a VSCode extension that offers visual "
"configuration, backend management, and research orchestration "
"capabilities. It supports two usage modes:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:6
msgid "**在线工作空间**：通过网页平台直接使用，无需本地安装，适合快速上手。"
msgstr ""
"**Online Workspace**: Use directly through the web platform, no local "
"installation required, ideal for quick onboarding."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:7
msgid "**本地开发**：在本地安装扩展和依赖，适合需要自定义环境的高级用户。"
msgstr ""
"**Local Development**: Install the extension and dependencies locally, "
"suitable for advanced users who need a customized environment."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:12
msgid "在线工作空间"
msgstr "Online Workspace"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:14
msgid ""
"我们推荐使用在线平台进行实验，平台已预装 agentsociety2 库、AI Social Scientist 插件和 Claude Code "
"CLI。"
msgstr ""
"We recommend using the online platform for experiments. The platform "
"comes pre-installed with the agentsociety2 library, the AI Social "
"Scientist extension, and the Claude Code CLI."

