#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:140
msgid ""
"也可以通过 AI Social Scientist 插件的 **高级配置 → Claude / Codex 路由** "
"打开图形化配置页，使用内置的本地 AI Gateway 统一管理供应商（见下文）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:146
msgid "本地 AI Gateway"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:148
msgid ""
"**AI Gateway** 是插件内置的本地 HTTP 代理，运行在 ``127.0.0.1:15721-15820`` 端口范围内。它拦截 "
"Claude Code 和 Codex CLI 的 API 请求，将其转发到你 配置的上游供应商，并自动完成协议格式转换与模型名映射。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:152
msgid ""
"它的核心价值在于：**让你用任意第三方 LLM 供应商（OpenAI 兼容、智谱、 DeepSeek 等）来驱动 Claude Code / "
"Codex**，无需每个供应商都去申请 官方 Anthropic / OpenAI 账号。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:156
msgid "简单说，请求流是这样的："
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:168
msgid ""
"Gateway 对 Claude Code 始终呈现一个标准的 Anthropic Messages 端点 "
"（``/v1/messages``），对 Codex 始终呈现一个标准的 OpenAI Responses 端点 "
"（``/v1/responses``）。因此这两个 CLI 不需要知道背后其实是哪家供应商、 哪种协议——Gateway 会在中间完成所有转换。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:174
msgid "供应商与路由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:176
msgid ""
"Gateway 提供一个**共享供应商池**——供应商只保存一份，但可以在供应商 卡片上分别「激活」到 Claude Code 或 Codex "
"CLI 角色："
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:179
msgid ""
"**Anthropic 原生供应商** （如 ``api.anthropic.com``、DeepSeek 的 ``/anthropic`` "
"端点）：直接服务 Claude Code，请求直通转发。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:180
msgid ""
"**OpenAI 兼容供应商** （如 ``api.openai.com``、智谱 ``paas/v4``、DeepSeek "
"``/v1``）：可同时服务 Claude Code 和 Codex CLI。 - 服务 Claude Code 时，Gateway 会把 "
"Claude Code 发出的 **Anthropic Messages** 请求实时翻译成 **OpenAI Chat "
"Completions**，再把返回的 SSE 流翻译回去。 - 服务 Codex CLI 时，Gateway 会把 Codex 发出的 "
"**OpenAI Responses** 请求翻译成 **OpenAI Chat Completions**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:184
msgid "添加供应商时需要选择正确的接口类型："
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:186
msgid "若供应商提供 Anthropic Messages 协议（``/v1/messages``），选择 **Anthropic**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:187
msgid "若供应商只提供 OpenAI Chat 协议（``/v1/chat/completions``），选择 **OpenAI 兼容**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:189
msgid ""
"内置预设已覆盖常见供应商（Anthropic、DeepSeek、智谱、Kimi、MiniMax、 "
"火山引擎、OpenRouter、阿里百炼、Moonshot、SiliconFlow 等），可直接选用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:193
msgid "协议格式转换"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:195
msgid "Gateway 在转发过程中会做以下转换，确保第三方模型的行为尽可能贴近原生体验："
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:197
msgid ""
"**请求方向**：``system`` 提示、``tools`` 工具定义、``tool_choice``、 "
"``thinking``（扩展思考，会映射为 ``reasoning_effort``）、``max_tokens`` 等都会按目标协议规范化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:200
msgid ""
"**响应方向**：第三方模型的 ``reasoning_content``（思考过程）会被翻译成 Anthropic 的 ``thinking``"
" 内容块；``tool_calls`` 会被翻译成 ``tool_use`` 内容块，保证 Claude Code "
"能正确识别工具调用（这是保证工具调用 / 多轮 对话不中断的关键）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:204
msgid ""
"**模型名映射**：Claude Code 发出的 ``claude-sonnet-*`` / ``claude-opus-*`` / "
"``claude-haiku-*`` / ``claude-fable-*`` 会自动映射为供应商配置的对应角色 模型；``[1M]`` "
"等本地能力标记会在转发前剥离，避免泄漏给供应商。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:209
msgid "故障转移与用量统计"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:211
msgid ""
"**故障转移**：可为 Claude 和 Codex 分别开启多供应商优先级，单点失败后 自动切换到下一个候选供应商，并由断路器（circuit "
"breaker）抑制反复 失败的上游。切换成功后会更新活跃供应商，UI 会同步反映。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:214
msgid ""
"**用量统计**：面板按天展示请求趋势，区分 Claude 与 Codex 来源，支持 7 天 / 30 天 / 全部 "
"筛选。会分别统计输入、输出、缓存读取、缓存写入 token。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:216
msgid ""
"**费用估算**：定价来源优先级为 **自定义 > 远程（OpenRouter / LiteLLM）> 内置**， 远程定价 24 小时缓存。对 "
"Codex / OpenAI 兼容记录，会先从可计费输入中 扣除缓存命中再计费，缓存读取单独计价。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:219
msgid ""
"**状态栏**：启用 Gateway 后，VS Code 状态栏会显示 ``AI Gateway`` 及当前 路由状态（Claude / "
"Codex / Claude + Codex），点击即可回到配置页。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:223
msgid "Gateway 排错"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:225
msgid ""
"**查看日志**：打开 ``AI CLI Gateway Log`` 输出通道，每行记录请求路径、 上游地址、HTTP 状态码、耗时与模型名，形如"
" ``POST /v1/messages → 200 (4183ms) [deepseek-v4-pro] [https://...]``。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:228
msgid "**日志显示 ``in:0 out:0``**：表示该次响应未提取到 token 用量，常见于流 式响应提前中断或上游未返回 usage 字段。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:230
msgid ""
"**请求中断 / 对话到一半停止**：通常是对话中触发了工具调用，但旧版本 网关未正确翻译 "
"``tool_calls``。请确认使用的是已修复该问题的扩展版本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:232
msgid ""
"**403 key_model_access_denied**：上游拒绝该 API Key 访问请求的模型， "
"说明模型名映射未生效或供应商未开通该模型权限，请在供应商卡片核对模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:234
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**手动校验健康状态**：``curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/health`` 应返回 ``{\"ok\": true,"
" ...}``。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:237
msgid "也可以安装 Claude Code 的 VSCode 插件，点击扩展侧边栏的\"AI 对话\"后会直接弹出 Claude Code 对话页面："
msgstr ""
"You can also install the Claude Code VSCode extension. Clicking \"AI "
"Chat\" in the extension sidebar will open the Claude Code chat panel "
"directly:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:239
msgid "Claude Code VSCode 集成"
msgstr "Claude Code VSCode integration"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:245
msgid ""
"同步到 ``.claude/skills/`` 的技能可被 Claude Code 和 Cursor 自动识别。插件也会自动为 CodeX "
"创建符号链接（``.codex``），无需手动操作。"
msgstr ""
"Skills synced to ``.claude/skills/`` are automatically recognized by "
"Claude Code and Cursor. The extension also creates a symbolic link for "
"CodeX (``.codex``) automatically — no manual action needed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:250
msgid "环境配置"
msgstr "Environment Configuration"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:253
msgid "新建工作区"
msgstr "Create a New Workspace"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:255
msgid "在线工作空间中，在左侧文件树新建一个文件夹作为工作区（如 ``demo``），然后通过 ``File → Open Folder`` 打开。"
msgstr ""
"In the online workspace, create a new folder in the left file tree as "
